      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تخدّد</span></b>  <i>It</i> (the ground) <i>became furrowed,</i>
or <i>cleft,</i> by a torrent. (L in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فصد</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
also 2, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تخدّد القَوْمُ</span> (tropical:)  <i>The people
became divided into distinct bodies,</i> or <i>parties.</i>
(L in the present art.)


